      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "verl/experimental/fully_async_policy/README.md",
      "patch": "@@ -171,7 +171,7 @@ https://github.com/ArronHZG/verl-community/blob/main/docs/fully_async_policy_rev\n \n   During the training process, we observed that metrics and response lengths may become unstable in the later\n   stages of training. To mitigate this issue, we can use\n-  the [Rollout Importance Sampling](https://verl.readthedocs.io/en/latest/advance/rollout_is.html)\n+  the [Rollout Importance Sampling](https://verl.readthedocs.io/en/latest/algo/rollout_corr.html)\n   technique for importance sampling. To utilize Rollout Importance Sampling, we need to compute log_prob using\n   the training engine, which requires enabling this switch.\n   Additionally, when `algorithm.rollout_correction.bypass_mode=False` and Rollout Importance Sampling are enabled under",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/verl-project/verl/raw/88ff973a2c51ecae473195aa1c1eaf217cd429a2/verl%2Fexperimental%2Ffully_async_policy%2FREADME.md",
      "sha": "44e24204ea88b9b4af0e4f57592085212245a13b",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 1,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/verl-project/verl/blob/88ff973a2c51ecae473195aa1c1eaf217cd429a2/verl%2Fexperimental%2Ffully_async_policy%2FREADME_zh.md",
      "changes": 2,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/verl-project/verl/contents/verl%2Fexperimental%2Ffully_async_policy%2FREADME_zh.md?ref=88ff973a2c51ecae473195aa1c1eaf217cd429a2",
      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "verl/experimental/fully_async_policy/README_zh.md",
      "patch": "@@ -131,7 +131,7 @@ https://github.com/ArronHZG/verl-community/blob/main/docs/fully_async_policy_rev\n   algorithm.rollout_correction.bypass_mode 默认为 True, 直接使用rollout log prob。\n \n   我们在训练过程中，观测到随着训练的进行，训练后期指标和response长度可能会出现不稳定的情况，\n-  这里我们可以使用 [Rollout Importance Sampling](https://verl.readthedocs.io/en/latest/advance/rollout_is.html) 的技术进行\n+  这里我们可以使用 [Rollout Importance Sampling](https://verl.readthedocs.io/en/latest/algo/rollout_corr.html) 的技术进行\n   重要性采样，缓解这一问题。为了使用 `Rollout Importance Sampling` 我们需要使用训练引擎使用当前的参数版本计算old_log_prob，此开关需要打开。\n   此外，在 mode d (async stream pipeline with partial rollout) 的情况下 `algorithm.rollout_correction.bypass_mode=False`\n   以及",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/verl-project/verl/raw/88ff973a2c51ecae473195aa1c1eaf217cd429a2/verl%2Fexperimental%2Ffully_async_policy%2FREADME_zh.md",
      "sha": "69d7d44d1395adef1aba96db82e9438baf4d75ee",
      "status": "modified"
    }
